License information
===================

This repository is a collection of separately licensed skill packages. It does
not have a single license that overrides those packages' terms.

For each skill, consult its SKILL.md license and attribution fields and the
LICENSE and NOTICE files shipped in that skill's folder. Those notices and any
upstream copyright statements continue to apply to adapted files.

See docs/third-party-sources.md for the source and attribution index and the
README.md License section for an overview. Do not infer a redistribution grant
for a file that has no applicable license notice; ask its copyright holder.
